## Blocks

```mdl
api A-1: the compiler and its text helpers
  signatures:
  - JsGen.compile : (Text -> {Throw Text | e} Option Sexp) -> (Text -> {Throw Text | e} Option Sexp) -> (Text -> {Throw Text | e} Text -> {Throw Text | e} Text) -> Map Text Entry -> Text -> List (Text, Text) -> Text -> Text -> {Throw Text | e} (Text, Text)
  - JsGen.mangle : Text -> Text
  - JsGen.vlq : Int -> Text
  - JsGen.unvlq : Text -> Int
```

```mdl
js JS-1: arithmetic wraps at 32 bits
  run: (2147483647 + 1, 7 / -2, -7 % 3, Int.ushr (-1) 28)
```

```mdl
js JS-10: a defect is caught by a Defect handler
  run: handle Int.toText (Int.div 1 0) with | Defect.raise m -> _ => m
```

```mdl
js JS-11: maps and dictionaries
  run: Map.toList (Map.fromList [("b", 2), ("a", 1)])
```

```mdl
js JS-2: a self tail call loops in constant stack
  run: JsGen.Spec.sumTo 100000 0
```

```mdl
js JS-3: data, matching and the prelude
  run: List.map JsGen.Spec.figureArea [JsGen.Spec.Figure.circle 2, JsGen.Spec.Figure.rect 3 4]
```

```mdl
js JS-4: text is UTF-16 code units
  run: (Text.length "😀", Text.split "a,b,,c" ",", Int.fromText "-12", Text.code "é" 0)
```

```mdl
js JS-5: a resumptive handler answers the request where it is made
  run: JsGen.Spec.answer JsGen.Spec.twice
```

```mdl
js JS-6: an abortive handler is the result of the handle
  run: (try (fun _ => JsGen.Spec.safeDiv 1 0), try (fun _ => JsGen.Spec.safeDiv 9 3))
```

```mdl
js JS-7: partial application and closures
  run: List.map (Int.add 10) (List.filter (fun x => x % 2 == 0) (List.range 0 7))
```

```mdl
js JS-8: mutable cells
  run: JsGen.Spec.counter 10
```

```mdl
js JS-9: structural equality and order
  run: (some [1, 2] == some [1, 2], compare (1, "b") (1, "a"), List.sort [3, 1, 2])
```

```mdl
law L-1: every name mangles to a JavaScript identifier
  theorem: JsGen.Spec.mangleIsIdent
```

```mdl
law L-2: source map numbers decode to what was encoded
  theorem: JsGen.Spec.vlqRoundTrip
```

```mdl
req R-1: each definition is a JavaScript function named after it, so stacks read as DEUS
  by: JsGen.Spec.namesAreIdentifiers
```

```mdl
req R-2: a handler whose clause resumes twice, or after more work, is refused by name
  gap: task 508d9443
```
